{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-13","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"um … zu oder damit","bn":"um … zu নাকি damit"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lerne Deutsch, ___ in Deutschland zu arbeiten.","options":["damit","obwohl","um"],"answer":2,"explanation":"একই কর্তা, শেষে zu + infinitive → um … zu।","id":"b1-practice-13-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lerne Deutsch, ___ meine Frau mich versteht.","options":["damit","um","zu"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কর্তা আলাদা (ich / meine Frau) → damit।","id":"b1-practice-13-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich spare Geld, um ein Auto ___.","options":["kaufe","zu kaufen","kaufen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"um … zu + infinitive।","id":"b1-practice-13-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কখন um … zu ব্যবহার করা হয়?","options":["দুই অংশের কর্তা আলাদা হলে","অতীতের কথা বললে","দুই অংশের কর্তা একই হলে"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-13-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er geht zum Arzt, ___ er gesund wird.","options":["damit","um","falls"],"answer":0,"explanation":"এখানে damit-এর অংশে নিজস্ব কর্তা er আর verb শেষে।","id":"b1-practice-13-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir fahren nach Berlin, um unsere Freunde ___.","options":["besuchen","zu besuchen","besuchen zu"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-13-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich rufe an, um einen Termin ___. (machen)","options":["mache","gemacht","zu machen"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-13-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Ich stehe früh auf, um den Bus zu nehmen.","Ich stehe früh auf, um zu nehmen den Bus.","Ich stehe früh auf, damit den Bus zu nehmen."],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-13-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Falls ich Zeit ___, komme ich mit.","options":["haben","habe","hat"],"answer":1,"explanation":"falls-এর অংশে verb শেষে।","id":"b1-practice-13-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„falls“ মানে কী?","options":["যদি","যাতে","যদিও"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-13-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„höflich“ মানে কী?","options":["আসক্ত","ভদ্র","রাগান্বিত"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-13-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„gebraucht“ মানে কী?","options":["একদম নতুন","অকেজো","ব্যবহৃত"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-13-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„anprobieren“ মানে কী?","options":["পরে দেখা (কাপড়)","খুলে ফেলা (প্যাকেট)","ডেবিট করা"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-13-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Seitdem er in Köln ___, sehen wir uns nicht oft. (wohnen)","options":["wohne","wohnt","wohnen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-13-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ dir morgen das Buch. (geben, ভবিষ্যৎ অর্থে বর্তমান)","options":["gibst","geben","gebe"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A1: ich gebe।","id":"b1-practice-13-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":8,"vocabulary":8}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-13","level":"B1","test":[]}